  "application_type_full": "Tree works: Trees in conservation areas/subject to TPOs",
  "description": "1 x Oak (T1) - a crown reduction and crown clean. The reduction of 1 meter all around is intended to achieve a more balanced and aesthetically pleasing shape while also improving the tree's overall health and structural integrity. This will address the current asymmetrical growth and reduce the risk of limb failure, especially during high winds. The tree currently has an approximate crown radius of 6.5 meters, and following the works, the crown radius will be reduced to approximately 5.5 meters.\rNote: The Council has withdrawn application 25/01323/TPO. The tree identified (Oak at 3 Harriet Tubman Close, London SW2 2UQ) is not subject to any Tree Preservation Order and is not located within a Conservation Area. The application was validated in error and is not required.",
